{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a desktop game. The little people in the farm will take care of the farm by themselves while you are working or studying. You can also manually operate to speed up this process. The farm will dynamically switch between day and night based on your time. During the night, the growth rate of plants will change (various plants will have different changing trends). During this period, you can also make more friends, and they can help you manage the farm more conveniently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/eb42e697e5e962602a1c7a019bd82e08.avif?t=1759899584\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planting - Watering - Harvesting - Picking. The farmer will do it all by himself. Of course, you can also operate manually (except for picking).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/7ae1d4f436f10093780049fa2c3f0974.poster.avif?t=1759899584\" width=612 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/7ae1d4f436f10093780049fa2c3f0974.webm?t=1759899584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/7ae1d4f436f10093780049fa2c3f0974.mp4?t=1759899584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/5fa3d20f71ec110dc2cede2ba2804af6.poster.avif?t=1759899584\" width=612 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/5fa3d20f71ec110dc2cede2ba2804af6.webm?t=1759899584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/5fa3d20f71ec110dc2cede2ba2804af6.mp4?t=1759899584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/d249a44202765777632b913aaa7b5dea.poster.avif?t=1759899584\" width=612 height=88 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/d249a44202765777632b913aaa7b5dea.webm?t=1759899584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/d249a44202765777632b913aaa7b5dea.mp4?t=1759899584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/05929ece2804e3ffe59124413b4643b2.avif?t=1759899584\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, a lost hunter will enter your farm. He will periodically go out to search for treasures, bringing back not only new seeds but also other companions. Each of them has their own unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/0ce1e46d1a9cd2e9112f303390846ecf.poster.avif?t=1759899584\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/0ce1e46d1a9cd2e9112f303390846ecf.gif?t=1759899584\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/31b8e756d2c627ccc4f756399bec7ab8.avif?t=1759899584\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can put the harvested crops into the windmill, and soon you will get the seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: Manual operation is not allowed.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/cf0249958dcdbcc76f344058c60ba334.poster.avif?t=1759899584\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/cf0249958dcdbcc76f344058c60ba334.gif?t=1759899584\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/ea80f505d744819cc56a476f41c92436.avif?t=1759899584\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also an mimic on the farm! Don't be scared! It will only eat the crops. And as you know, the items eaten by the mimic will turn into gold coins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/d2d9698d31b16ef24b51ab8677fe486b.poster.avif?t=1759899584\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/d2d9698d31b16ef24b51ab8677fe486b.apng?t=1759899584\" class=\"bb_img\" width=612 height=112 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/7d7073b419623075173a08b0236fe332.avif?t=1759899584\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sun sets and night arrives. During the night, the growth rate of crops will vary. So what do you need at this time? Exactly! A beam of light!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/4b9c9fdfc0117797ce235136bf32fbbf.poster.avif?t=1759899584\" width=612 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/4b9c9fdfc0117797ce235136bf32fbbf.webm?t=1759899584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/4b9c9fdfc0117797ce235136bf32fbbf.mp4?t=1759899584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/37d6c266c1d12a750aa2f970e6ec7726.avif?t=1759899584\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look! A red dot is flying through the night sky. What is it? Click to see!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/72f0565c2d36d94866ec7d1a3866758f.poster.avif?t=1759899584\" width=612 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/72f0565c2d36d94866ec7d1a3866758f.webm?t=1759899584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/72f0565c2d36d94866ec7d1a3866758f.mp4?t=1759899584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/e86bf11fa3496510c8d19f6f9a3d696e.avif?t=1759899584\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_p